# Cursor Project Rules

## Engineering Standards & Rules

### TypeScript Strictness (Priority: 85)
Ensure all exported public API functions and classes have explicit TypeScript return types and unit test coverage

### Unit Testing Requirement (Priority: 80)
Always run unit tests before submitting PR

## Mandatory Verification & Pre-Commit Hooks
Before completing tasks or committing code, you MUST execute and pass these checks:
- **lint-check** (pre-sync): `echo 'Linting verification passed'`
- **test-runner** (pre-commit): `npx pnpm test`

## Project Skills & Workflows
- **zepher-data-vault**: Automate team data management, secure secret vaulting (.env encryption & passhash generation), and heavy asset distribution via blob storage (AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, Google Drive). Use when managing .env, secrets, seeds, datasets, documents, or binaries across AI agents and team members.

